anime series? At Vinyl Wrap Toronto, we specialize in custom anime-themed vinyl wraps designed uniquely for your car, truck, or SUV. Our experienced in-house designers and certified installers serve Etobicoke, Toronto, and the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), delivering premium anime car wraps tailored to your vision and style.</p><p>We use high-quality vinyl from trusted brands to ensure each wrap not only looks stunning but also provides long-lasting protection for your vehicle’s paint. Whether you’re attending a car meet, anime convention, or just want to stand out on the streets, we’ll make sure your wrap gets you noticed.</p>", "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:300", "eid": "a87929e"}], "padding": null, "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": null, "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "26c80da", "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Eye-catching Anime Car Wraps in the GTA", "href": null, "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:25px;color:var( --e-global-color-d077a13 );font-weight:600;text-transform:none", "eid": "293659c"}, {"type": "text", "html": "<p>Anime car wraps are an exciting and creative way to express your love for anime culture while giving your vehicle a unique aesthetic. With Vinyl Wrap Toronto’s expert vehicle graphics services, you can:</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400", "eid": "0870570"}, {"type": "list", "items": [{"text": "Showcase your passion for anime with bold, high-resolution designs", "href": null, "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"}, {"text": "Protect your factory paint from sun damage, scratches, and minor abrasions", "href": null, "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"}, {"text": "Easily remove or change your wrap when you’re ready for a new character or series", "href": null, "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"}, {"text": "Turn heads everywhere you go with a one-of-a-kind, professionally wrapped vehicle", "href": null, "icon": "fas fa-check-circle"}], "style": null, "itemStyle": "font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400", "eid": "f504f2d"}, {"type": "text", "html": "<p>Whether you’re into classic anime, modern hits, or niche favourites, our team can bring your concept to life on virtually any type of vehicle.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400", "eid": "bd1c390"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Anime-Themed-Car-Wrap-Transparent-1-1024x375.webp", "alt": "Anime Themed Car Wrap - Transparent - 1", "width": "800", "height": "293", "href": null, "full": false, "eid": "5455b70", "box": "margin:0px 0px 0px -90px"}], "padding": null, "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#14A27814", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "6585c23", "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Some of Our Work", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:30px;color:var( --e-global-color-d077a13 );font-weight:600;text-transform:none", "eid": "8c0a636"}, {"type": "filtergallery", "filters": [], "items": [{"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524-6.webp", "title": "Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524 - 6", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524-5.webp", "title": "Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524 - 5", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524-4.webp", "title": "Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524 - 4", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524-3.webp", "title": "Personal-Partial-Wrap-Nissan-GTR-Anime-North-20240524 - 3", "ta